{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05、S13等段落的感受提示偏密，个别如“年少时初恋”“多年后走进旧房子”的联想也容易把观众带离眼前情境。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"平\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然感受内容更多，但【】突出叙事重点，感受字级较小且部分随音乐分时出现，观众更容易先抓住人物正在经历什么，再捕捉细微情绪。反复出现的水面、船、摇荡、靠岸等意象也让前后情绪有连续性，感受比X更具体、更贴近音乐变化。X的完整句子在解释因果方面同样清楚，甚至更稳一些，因此人物动机这一项我判平；Y的主要问题是部分段落感受提示过密，偶尔有意象过度阐释。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fece1edf-7db3-43ae-aec3-1373122e1265", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005525666096Z", "elapsed_seconds": 90.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:56:55.690064+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "16873be84bc3cb95069a03ec691d457fbe7d6e131c9d44a221b6bdcf5e1f6f7e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt